WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:32.530 --> 01:39.770
Chocolat! Hey! Chocolat! Aah...she
hasn't woken up yet...

01:44.340 --> 01:47.540
Hey, Chocolat! Wake up, already!
You lazybones!

01:49.280 --> 01:51.000
How long are you going to sleep?

01:53.050 --> 01:58.010
Houx! Saule! Am I in the Magical World?!

01:59.120 --> 02:01.020
Breakfast is ready.

02:02.160 --> 02:03.390
Help yourself, Princess.

02:04.090 --> 02:05.180
Thanks.

02:16.200 --> 02:18.370
Chocolat-chan, what's going on?

02:18.810 --> 02:19.310
'Sup!

02:20.340 --> 02:21.910
Good morning, Vanilla.

02:22.280 --> 02:25.750
Houx! Saule! Chocolat-chan, what's going on?

02:25.750 --> 02:28.820
Well...what are you two doing
in the human world, anyway?

02:29.180 --> 02:32.550
From this day forward, we're going
to the same school as Chocolat.

02:32.890 --> 02:33.690
That's how it is.

02:34.090 --> 02:34.920
Huh!?

02:34.920 --> 02:36.630
To Moegi Gakuen?

02:37.030 --> 02:38.400
Thanks for having us!

02:38.960 --> 02:40.390
No way!

02:42.030 --> 02:44.060
The Magician Transfer Students.

02:46.870 --> 02:47.330
Really?

02:48.940 --> 02:50.940
We got permission from Queen Candy!

02:51.270 --> 02:54.020
You can teach us lots of things, Chocolat, Vanilla.

02:54.340 --> 02:56.440
I've already thought of names
for you two.

02:56.440 --> 03:00.030
Saule will be Yuji Kato.
Houx, you're Shuuji Kato.

03:00.030 --> 03:03.150
You'll be posing as Chocolat's cousins.

03:03.150 --> 03:04.550
"Houx" and "Saule" are just fine!

03:05.120 --> 03:08.220
I can teach you guys anything
about the human world!

03:08.220 --> 03:10.820
You can't trust anything that Chocolat tells you!

03:11.360 --> 03:12.560
I have to agree-kero!

03:12.930 --> 03:14.060
Shove it, you guys!

03:15.360 --> 03:20.130
Nice to meet-chu!
I am Vanilla-chama's familiar, Blanca!

03:20.610 --> 03:23.010
I'm Duke, Chocolat's familiar-kerooaAAH!

03:23.440 --> 03:26.610
Don't bother yourself with such a lazy
worthless bum like Chocolat!

03:26.610 --> 03:31.450
Vanilla-chama...Vanilla-chama is counting
on you! Houx-chama, Saule-chama!

03:31.450 --> 03:32.910
B...Blanca...

03:33.380 --> 03:35.550
Seems like you two are having a hard time.

03:36.150 --> 03:40.920
Now that we're here, it'll be okay! We'll
protect both Chocolat and Vanilla!

03:53.030 --> 03:54.840
R...Rockin' Robin-sama.

03:55.200 --> 03:56.740
Robin-sama, wonderful!

03:56.740 --> 03:58.040
So cool!

03:58.040 --> 04:00.010
Chocolat, who are those guys?

04:00.010 --> 04:05.220
Ah! Oh, they're my cousins. They're
middle-school transfers...

04:05.750 --> 04:06.310
Pleasure to meet you.

04:07.050 --> 04:07.720
Nice to meetcha!

04:08.280 --> 04:10.220
Th...the pleasure's all mine!

04:10.550 --> 04:13.020
Let's be friends, you dimwits.

04:13.020 --> 04:16.190
But if you pick on Chocolat, we'll
beat you to a bloody pulp.

04:16.730 --> 04:16.730
Eh?

04:17.860 --> 04:22.460
Sorry! Sorry! They sound like they're wild,
but they're really nice deep down.

04:22.860 --> 04:25.200
Y...you can tell it runs in the family.

04:25.200 --> 04:25.740
No kidding.

04:26.200 --> 04:30.510
Cut it out! Manners in the human world are
totally different from the Magic World's!

04:30.510 --> 04:31.510
Really?

04:31.510 --> 04:32.770
Man, what a pain.

04:34.180 --> 04:37.710
Well, hate to split, baby. Until next time.

04:40.380 --> 04:42.080
Let's get to the faculty's office.

04:42.080 --> 04:42.950
Right.

04:42.950 --> 04:43.450
Yeah.

04:44.020 --> 04:49.320
Be careful you guys. They can't find out that
we're witches, or we're in deep trouble!

05:00.700 --> 05:03.270
Will it really be okay?

05:03.270 --> 05:04.940
It's really worrisome, isn't it?

05:05.310 --> 05:07.580
You're feeling uneasy about it too, huh?

05:07.580 --> 05:08.380
Kato.

05:08.380 --> 05:09.040
Huh?

05:09.040 --> 05:10.960
What was all the fuss about this morning?

05:10.960 --> 05:16.290
Rockin' Robin waltzing around like that.
Saying lame stuff like "baby..."

05:16.640 --> 05:17.300
Mimura,

05:17.300 --> 05:20.320
could it be that you're jealous because you aren't as popular with the ladies as Robin is?

05:20.320 --> 05:21.500
N-no way!

05:24.460 --> 05:25.260
Hey, over there!

05:25.660 --> 05:26.940
Leave Chocolat alone!

05:29.760 --> 05:31.430
Who are you guys?

05:31.800 --> 05:34.770
D-didn't you guys just come through the window!?

05:35.170 --> 05:39.890
Y-you're seeing things! Seeing things!
Seeing things! Seeing things!

05:41.080 --> 05:41.740
Who's that?

05:42.180 --> 05:44.140
Chocolat's cousins.

05:44.550 --> 05:47.380
Geez, don't make such a scene, for crying out loud!

05:47.850 --> 05:48.280
Sorry.

05:48.680 --> 05:52.520
But we came to the human
world to protect you guys.

05:52.520 --> 05:55.860
If you two are in danger, we'll fly to your rescue.

05:55.860 --> 05:57.620
What are you babbling about?

05:58.360 --> 06:02.130
Anyone associated with Kato is a freak!

06:05.600 --> 06:07.740
Wh...what the? What'd you do?!

06:07.740 --> 06:09.140
You guys are aliens, too!

06:09.340 --> 06:11.470
No! No, listen! Uh, you see--!

06:13.510 --> 06:15.350
QiGong: Chinese manipulation of life-force

06:13.510 --> 06:14.910
It's QiGong!

06:15.350 --> 06:19.850
QiGong, you know? They... they're QiGong masters!

06:20.450 --> 06:21.820
Cool!

06:21.820 --> 06:23.120
They're so strong!

06:23.420 --> 06:24.920
Vanilla, nice save!

06:25.250 --> 06:30.870
Ow-ow-ow! QiGong?! You...! Huh?

06:31.360 --> 06:34.930
So! Lunchtime! The cafeteria's this way!

06:44.810 --> 06:46.670
Man, I'm totaly on edge!

06:47.040 --> 06:49.910
I always feel that way just watching you!

06:50.950 --> 06:51.780
I see.

06:52.280 --> 06:53.910
So you can't go off judging others, Chocolat.

06:54.250 --> 06:57.650
So what am I supposed to do if you make
me even more unpopular with the guys?

06:59.490 --> 07:01.120
So these are the new middle-school transfers.

07:01.690 --> 07:03.360
So you're her cousins, huh?

07:08.000 --> 07:09.700
Lovely ladies...

07:09.700 --> 07:11.110
...please look favorably upon we three cousins.

07:12.930 --> 07:14.070
O... of course.

07:16.570 --> 07:18.370
Amazing. Houx and Saule...

07:18.810 --> 07:20.370
...are so popular with the girls!

07:21.880 --> 07:22.880
Prince!

07:30.890 --> 07:35.420
In the Magic World the other day...
I thought I saw Pierre...

07:37.660 --> 07:40.060
What? Why are you staring at me like that?

07:40.290 --> 07:42.200
I-I'm not staring!

07:43.160 --> 07:46.400
Oh? Here I thought you had a crush on me.

07:46.870 --> 07:48.100
What'd you say?!

07:48.800 --> 07:52.370
If you don't, stop looking at me like that.

07:53.440 --> 07:54.440
Who the hell are you?!

07:54.940 --> 07:57.440
Chocolat would never like a jerk like you!

07:58.610 --> 08:01.910
Talkin to the Prince like that? How rude!

08:02.180 --> 08:03.850
What's this "Prince" business?!

08:04.350 --> 08:05.920
Don't come any closer to Chocolat!

08:08.190 --> 08:10.670
Are you two pretending to be Chocolat's
Knights in shining armor?

08:10.960 --> 08:13.360
What?! You? I'll whup your butt!

08:13.800 --> 08:16.700
You can have Chocolat over our dead bodies!

08:17.200 --> 08:19.770
I see. So this is a challenge, then?

08:19.770 --> 08:22.960
Seriously? If so, we accept!

08:22.960 --> 08:24.310
W-wait!

08:24.310 --> 08:26.420
So, what'll it be?

08:27.040 --> 08:29.440
Well, a tennis match, then?

08:30.510 --> 08:32.190
Tennis?

08:32.190 --> 08:36.200
Even against the two of you together,
I'll still win.

08:36.200 --> 08:41.160
What'd you say?!
Fine, tennis it is! We accept!

08:41.890 --> 08:42.520
Prince...

08:43.560 --> 08:44.930
Will you be the referee?

08:45.790 --> 08:46.230
Yes.

08:47.260 --> 08:48.930
Then, after school. In the court.

08:49.760 --> 08:53.170
Ah! Prince! Wait! Prince!

08:53.170 --> 08:56.400
What are you two thinking, going up against Pierre?

08:57.100 --> 08:58.240
But he...

08:58.840 --> 09:01.240
Have you two ever played tennis?

09:01.680 --> 09:02.080
Nope!

09:02.480 --> 09:03.880
So, what's tennis?

09:04.210 --> 09:04.980
Hopeless!

09:05.580 --> 09:08.980
Pierre is the captain of both the
fencing and tennis teams!

09:09.280 --> 09:11.520
But we already committed. Right?

09:12.090 --> 09:13.350
Yup. Can't back down now!

09:14.060 --> 09:14.720
That's right!

09:20.260 --> 09:24.730
So Chocolat's cousins and Pierre-sama
are actually having a tennis match?!

09:25.830 --> 09:27.230
Man, word travels fast.

09:27.770 --> 09:30.710
Well sorry, but I have to stick with Pierre.

09:30.710 --> 09:32.970
We'll support Chocolat's cousins all the way!

09:34.010 --> 09:35.930
Everyone's getting worked up over this.

09:38.880 --> 09:40.780
Hey! Let's form a cheerleading group!

09:40.780 --> 09:44.480
Great idea! Chocolat, Vanilla, why don't
you two be the leaders of the group?

09:45.150 --> 09:46.450
Cheerleading?

09:46.890 --> 09:49.060
You dance and shout, and cheer up the team!

09:51.440 --> 09:52.930
C'mon! Do it!

09:52.930 --> 09:54.660
Yeah, do it!

09:55.030 --> 10:02.570
Alright, finally! I'll cheer 'em on really good
and get lots of hearts in the process!

10:16.380 --> 10:18.730
Now, you two gotta practice!

10:19.020 --> 10:19.490
Mmh!

10:23.360 --> 10:26.090
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

10:40.640 --> 10:41.270
Wand!

10:50.220 --> 10:50.980
Alright!

10:53.150 --> 10:55.420
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

10:56.290 --> 10:58.090
Tennis court...appear!

11:04.270 --> 11:06.970
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

11:09.770 --> 11:10.300
Wand!

11:12.240 --> 11:14.240
Rackets, please come out!

11:22.650 --> 11:25.550
Now, hit the ball with the racket! Got it?

11:25.940 --> 11:26.740
Got it.

11:26.740 --> 11:28.150
Here's the ball!

11:30.060 --> 11:30.710
Here we go!

11:32.090 --> 11:33.250
Huh?

11:33.530 --> 11:35.160
Ha! This is child's play!

11:39.730 --> 11:40.000
Huh?

11:41.570 --> 11:42.400
Hopeless.

11:42.800 --> 11:44.400
Completely hopeless.

11:45.910 --> 11:47.940
We'll have to use magic, or else...

11:48.510 --> 11:49.280
You're right.

11:50.850 --> 11:52.880
We'll manipulate it so no one sees.

11:52.880 --> 11:56.780
Yup. Chocolat, would you rather us lose to this guy?

11:57.350 --> 12:01.870
It's not that, it's just winning
against Pierre with magic...

12:02.720 --> 12:06.320
What's with that guy? He's got weird vibes.

12:11.900 --> 12:14.470
That's why I don't want him to get any closer to you.

12:14.840 --> 12:15.670
That's right!

12:31.790 --> 12:36.650
Hmph. So what's the big deal?
I hope they get pulverized.

12:36.650 --> 12:38.760
They don't stand a chance against Pierre.

12:39.290 --> 12:40.960
But there's something strange about those guys.

12:51.210 --> 12:52.340
Nice, as expected!

12:52.340 --> 12:53.540
Great fit!

12:54.510 --> 12:57.080
Well, at least they look good...

13:03.850 --> 13:08.100
Go, go! Saule! Go, go, Houx!

13:17.700 --> 13:19.640
I keep messing up!

13:22.240 --> 13:23.340
Vanilla-chan!

13:23.340 --> 13:24.570
So cute!

13:27.070 --> 13:27.940
Ah-ha!

13:30.010 --> 13:32.680
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

13:35.620 --> 13:36.080
Wand!

13:37.950 --> 13:39.950
Please come to me, hearts!

13:48.430 --> 13:49.360
Did it!

13:50.030 --> 13:51.440
V...Vanilla...

13:51.440 --> 13:54.030
Huh? Vanilla got some hearts?

13:54.400 --> 13:58.400
Unlike the Magic World, quiet girls are more
popular with guys than louder girls.

13:58.710 --> 13:59.470
Really?

14:08.920 --> 14:10.320
Pierre-sama!

14:10.320 --> 14:11.480
Do your best!

14:25.400 --> 14:27.500
That guy...we'll definitely beat him!

14:28.600 --> 14:30.100
I won't let him near Chocolat!

14:30.540 --> 14:31.000
Yeah.

14:32.840 --> 14:34.370
This is a one-set match.

14:34.840 --> 14:35.310
Right.

14:35.740 --> 14:36.280
Understood.

14:38.150 --> 14:38.980
Play!

14:39.380 --> 14:41.080
I wonder who will win!

14:42.180 --> 14:43.520
Pierre's got this one in the bag!

14:58.570 --> 14:59.540
Fifteen, love!

15:08.680 --> 15:09.440
Wow.

15:09.810 --> 15:12.550
Vanilla-chan, you're not supposed to say that!

15:12.550 --> 15:14.250
Oops. Really?

15:17.690 --> 15:18.520
Thirty, love.

15:27.020 --> 15:27.990
Forty, love.

15:37.710 --> 15:39.750
You two, keep it up!

15:40.130 --> 15:43.110
Whup Pierre's butt! Do you best!

15:44.580 --> 15:45.000
Alright.

15:45.210 --> 15:45.810
Let's do it.

15:56.790 --> 15:57.560
There!

15:59.730 --> 16:00.530
Check this out.

16:10.740 --> 16:11.740
Forty, fifteen.

16:15.240 --> 16:16.540
What just happened?

16:17.180 --> 16:18.140
Amazing. The ball...

16:26.650 --> 16:27.620
Forty, thirty.

16:30.220 --> 16:32.390
Here's the magic ace of love!

16:37.930 --> 16:38.500
Deuce!

16:44.810 --> 16:45.940
Prince...

16:45.940 --> 16:50.220
He's never had a problem with
middle-school players before.

16:50.220 --> 16:53.280
Wow! Pierre's met his match!

16:53.280 --> 16:55.230
They're so good at tennis!

17:16.200 --> 17:17.070
Why is it,

17:18.410 --> 17:21.510
Even though Pierre's perfection is
so attractive,

17:23.440 --> 17:25.580
Now, seeing him grimy and
sweaty, is just as amazing!

17:33.920 --> 17:36.160
Chocolat, why are you gawking?

17:36.160 --> 17:38.560
We're cheering on your cousins!

17:40.760 --> 17:42.130
Now, let's finish him off!

17:42.460 --> 17:43.130
Yeah.

17:44.830 --> 17:46.470
Alright, here!

17:50.070 --> 17:52.870
Well, it's been fun, guys.

17:53.270 --> 17:54.040
Here.

17:55.640 --> 17:56.980
Ouch!

17:59.480 --> 18:00.310
And so, here...

18:01.380 --> 18:02.180
...is the end.

18:12.160 --> 18:13.360
Houx! Saule!

18:15.060 --> 18:16.730
Are you two okay?

18:17.730 --> 18:19.170
Ow...

18:20.400 --> 18:22.240
It's impossible to resume the match.

18:23.340 --> 18:26.120
And so, the winner is Prince Pierre!

18:30.870 --> 18:33.880
I was going easy on you, but I guess
it was a bit to much.

18:34.750 --> 18:35.980
We weren't giving it our all!

18:36.380 --> 18:37.520
We're just fine.

18:38.190 --> 18:41.920
Is that so? Your magic wasn't
that impressive.

18:43.730 --> 18:46.860
Pierre. You just said "magic..."

18:47.530 --> 18:49.760
Well. You must be hearing things.

18:50.930 --> 18:52.470
Pierre, the other day...

18:53.430 --> 18:53.900
"The other day?"

18:57.170 --> 18:57.940
Nothing.

18:59.710 --> 19:00.910
Today was fun.

19:28.870 --> 19:30.640
That's tonight's curry!

19:30.640 --> 19:32.440
Mm! Smells good!

19:35.640 --> 19:37.140
Ooh, looks yummy!

19:38.110 --> 19:40.950
Sorry, Chocolat. We couldn't beat that Pierre guy.

19:41.410 --> 19:42.880
This is our token of apology.

19:43.350 --> 19:45.490
You guys don't have to apologize.

19:45.490 --> 19:45.720
Mm!

19:46.520 --> 19:50.060
But we're here to protect Chocolat and Vanilla.

19:50.720 --> 19:54.230
Actually, we were asked directly by Queen Candy...

19:54.560 --> 19:55.460
By Mama?

19:57.330 --> 20:01.210
The truth is, there is a dark, shadowy movement detected in the human world.

20:01.210 --> 20:05.370
It is drawing nearer to the queen candidates.

20:05.940 --> 20:07.410
Queen Candy, that is...?

20:08.580 --> 20:10.580
We don't know what it is yet.

20:11.450 --> 20:17.220
So please, go to the human world and protect the two queen candidates as their knights.

20:17.950 --> 20:19.400
Yes. As you wish.

20:22.220 --> 20:23.760
"A dark, cold shadow?"

20:24.190 --> 20:25.420
What could it be?

20:28.200 --> 20:29.450
Fortune-telling book!

20:34.130 --> 20:35.230
You called?

20:39.010 --> 20:41.740
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

20:47.410 --> 20:49.980
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

20:51.320 --> 20:53.390
Divination Livre!

20:56.260 --> 20:59.830
What is this cold, dark shadow coming near us?

21:06.670 --> 21:13.050
The Trap of Darkness! This thing releases a strange light, mesmerizing young maidens.

21:13.050 --> 21:15.840
This temptation melts the maidens' hearts.

21:19.610 --> 21:20.550
What do you mean?

21:21.080 --> 21:23.630
Stay away from any strange guys!

21:32.030 --> 21:34.850
Oh yeah, Chocolat! Now that we're here, let's do it!

21:34.850 --> 21:36.810
Huh? Do what?

21:37.130 --> 21:38.360
You know, "that!"

21:38.970 --> 21:40.870
That thing you love so much!

21:49.840 --> 21:51.880
She's hopeless, isn't she?

21:52.310 --> 21:54.910
Even though she couldn't get any
hearts as a cheerleader-kero...

21:55.880 --> 21:59.890
...but Chocolat-chan was so into it.

22:00.920 --> 22:02.120
Yahoo!

22:03.050 --> 22:06.630
Well, now she's really into playing "Spider."

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:47.800 --> 23:49.110
I'm Chocolat!

23:49.110 --> 23:52.390
In order to become queen of the Magic World, I've come to the human world!

23:52.390 --> 23:54.320
Ch-Chocolat-chan!

23:54.320 --> 23:56.840
You better listen to me,
or I'll whup your butt!

23:56.840 --> 23:58.700
Ch-Chocolat-chan!

23:58.700 --> 24:00.430
What, Vanilla?

24:00.430 --> 24:03.710
When you're in my body, don't say something like "whup your butt!"

24:04.840 --> 24:06.690
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:06.690 --> 24:08.900
The Topsy-Turvy Macaroon Disaster!?

24:09.730 --> 24:12.930
How are we going to return to normal?!
